    <string name="about_what_title">What it is</string>
    <string name="about_what_body">ISSASPEAKER joins your Google Home speaker, your Google account, your music and AI models that run on your own keys, so services that never talk to each other can share one routine.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_title">Your data</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_body">There is no ISSASPEAKER server. Your keys, tokens and history stay on this phone, encrypted, and are left out of backups. Each permission is requested only when the feature that needs it is first used.</string>
